          {
            "question": "MCP中的Client承担什么职责？",
            "kind": "knowledge",
            "answer": "",
            "source_ids": [],
            "insufficient": null,
            "trace": {
              "mode": "hybrid",
              "queries": [
                {
                  "kind": "original",
                  "text": "MCP中的Client承担什么职责?"
                },
                {
                  "kind": "mqe",
                  "text": "Model Context Protocol 中 Client 的作用和功能有哪些?"
                },
                {
                  "kind": "mqe",
                  "text": "MCP client responsibilities and role in Model Context Protocol"
                },
                {
                  "kind": "hyde",
                  "text": "在 MCP(Model Context Protocol)中,MCP Client 是 Host 应用内创建的协议客户端实例,负责与一个或多个 MCP Server 建立、初始化和维护 JSON-RPC 2.0 连接,支持 stdio、SSE、Streamable HTTP 等传输方式。其核心职责包括:执行 initialize 握手、协议版本与 capability negotiation;发现、缓存并暴露 Server 的 tools、resources、prompts、resource templates、logging、completions 等能力;将 Host/LLM 请求路由为 tools/list、tools/call、resources/list、resources/read、resources/subscribe、prompts/list、prompts/get 等调用;接收并处理响应、错误、进度通知、取消、超时和重试;管理资源订阅与 notifications/resources/updated、notifications/tools/list_changed、notifications/prompts/list_changed 等变更通知;处理 Server 发起的 sampling/createMessage、roots/list 等反向请求;维护会话状态、安全边界、用户授权与最小权限控制。MCP Client 不实现模型推理或业务逻辑,而是作为 Host 与 Server 之间的协议适配层和请求路由器。"
                }
              ],
              "warnings": [],
              "reranked": false,
              "candidate_count": 12,
              "rerank_requested": false,
              "selected_count": 3,
              "selected_sources": [
                "interview-question://T005",
